            </note>
            <note corresp="#d115-f2" n="2" xml:id="d115-f2-content">
                <p>
                    Puhan reported on his latest meeting with
                    Marjai in telegram 757 from Budapest, May 10. (Ibid.) In telegram 788 from
                    Budapest, May 10, he analyzed the state of these talks. (Ibid.)</p>
            </note>
